OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court following
OL,4,Aanti-migrant protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of throwing a bottle at
OL,7,Fpolice during disorder at an
OL,8,Fanti-migrant protest in Portsmouth has
OL,9,Fappeared in court.
OL,11,FPolice attended Eastney Marina on 6
OL,12,FSeptember after hundreds of
OL,13,Fdemonstrators blocked roads in an
OL,14,Fattempt to stop coaches carrying 120
OL,15,Fmigrants, who had crossed the Channel
OL,16,Fin a dinghy, from leaving the city.
OL,18,FDel Leon Somerville, 42, from
OL,19,FPaulsgrove appeared at Portsmouth
OL,20,FMagistrates Court charged with violent
OL,21,Fdisorder and assaulting a police
OL,22,Fofficer.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
